/*
 * NETREAPER V7 — OLED + 3-Mode + MAX POWER JAM v2
 * GPIO4=Right/Scroll  GPIO5=Left/Select
 * OLED: SDA=25 SCL=26 VCC=3.3V GND=GND (0x3C)
 * LED: RF=GPIO2  Deauth=GPIO32
 * NRF24: HSPI(CE=27,CSN=15) VSPI(CE=22,CSN=21)
 *
 * MAX POWER RF JAM v2:
 *   - Both NRF24 radios SYNCED same channel (2x power per freq)
 *   - ESP32 WiFi AP_STA = noise on BOTH interfaces (2x WiFi interference)
 *   - 3 noise packets (128 bytes each) per channel hop
 *   - Broadcast fake deauth frame per hop (kills WiFi clients)
 *   - Total: 2x NRF24 carrier + 6x WiFi noise + 1x deauth per hop
 */
